 Release History
 ===============
 
+Unreleased
+==========
+
+	- Fix seqlet FASTA export to translate centered input-window coordinates
+	  into full-length sequence arrays and retain the first base of each seqlet.
+	  Preserve inclusive headers and forward-strand output; reject invalid
+	  input shapes, windows and seqlet bounds.
+
